# ~/.config/net-hardening/vpn-prefer
# Exit-IP ranges (CIDR, one per line) vpn-pick-server tries first. A server counts as
# preferred only if all of its exit IPs are inside these ranges; every other server is
# still used as a fallback. Blank lines and lines starting with # are ignored; lines
# that aren't valid CIDR are skipped with a warning.
# 192.0.2.0/24
# 198.51.100.0/24
